        "@value": "by substituting for the words \"the secured creditor until ~ ~ the court\" the words \"the secured creditor or the debenture holder until the court or the receiver or manager\". i: ! ~. ~: Amendment of section 32"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2000/7/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
